    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d997">

                <pb facs="0966" n="708" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg708"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 841.731/376a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Counselor for the Department of
                            State to the British Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Spring
                        Rice</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-02-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 16, 1915</hi>
                        </date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Ambassador</hi>: May I again call your
                    attention to the seriousness of the interruption by the British censors of
                    strictly commercial cablegrams pertaining to non-contraband goods exchanged
                    between this country and other neutral countries, especially Scandinavian
                    countries.</p>
                <p>It would be most gratifying if I could have your assistance in an effort to bring
                    about some arrangement with your Government whereby the relief which is needed
                    so much, not only by the United States but by the other neutral countries, may
                    be obtained.</p>
                <p>I should be very glad to discuss this matter with you whenever you can
                    conveniently call on me, and remain [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
